{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00090",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.27,
      "end_seconds": 6.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I brought my bag, is it fine to leave it here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.78,
      "end_seconds": 10.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Right on time. Sit, please. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.57,
      "end_seconds": 15.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.26,
      "end_seconds": 19.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 21.28,
      "end_seconds": 24.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "We came because of occasional chest tightness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.42,
      "end_seconds": 29.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "And when did that start? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.84,
      "end_seconds": 41.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "Honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before, you know, I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.15,
      "end_seconds": 45.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.81,
      "end_seconds": 49.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Resting helps a bit. I'd say severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.56,
      "end_seconds": 53.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "So, has there been poor sleep too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.7,
      "end_seconds": 60.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Um, yes, for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.12,
      "end_seconds": 64.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Have you had a bit of dizziness with the new tablets?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.59,
      "end_seconds": 72.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, two years. As for bit of dizziness with the new tablets, it's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.94,
      "end_seconds": 77.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.92,
      "end_seconds": 81.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.07,
      "end_seconds": 85.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Have you had any fainting, black stools or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.66,
      "end_seconds": 90.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "No fainting, black stools or palpitations, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.09,
      "end_seconds": 95.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.19,
      "end_seconds": 97.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.12,
      "end_seconds": 113.79,
      "duration_seconds": 15.67,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.93,
      "end_seconds": 117.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.6,
      "end_seconds": 121.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.12,
      "end_seconds": 125.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I'm allergic to dust, I get sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.86,
      "end_seconds": 129.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.6,
      "end_seconds": 135.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.12,
      "end_seconds": 138.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.17,
      "end_seconds": 143.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.57,
      "end_seconds": 158.56,
      "duration_seconds": 13.99,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.72,
      "end_seconds": 161.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.6,
      "end_seconds": 169.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.2,
      "end_seconds": 176.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Uh, I'm on rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, maybe, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.6,
      "end_seconds": 180.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.88,
      "end_seconds": 188.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.41,
      "end_seconds": 193.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.28,
      "end_seconds": 199.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "I've, I've got high cholesterol. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.28,
      "end_seconds": 202.23,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.76,
      "end_seconds": 210.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.03,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.89,
      "end_seconds": 216.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.17,
      "end_seconds": 221.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.07,
      "end_seconds": 222.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.1,
      "end_seconds": 235.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.56,
      "end_seconds": 246.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.41,
      "end_seconds": 268.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 124 over 72, pulse 66, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.58,
      "end_seconds": 270.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.01,
      "end_seconds": 287.96,
      "duration_seconds": 15.95,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.05,
      "end_seconds": 292.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.57,
      "end_seconds": 297.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.12,
      "end_seconds": 299.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Yes, um, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.32,
      "end_seconds": 303.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.33,
      "end_seconds": 317.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "The scar on your chest has healed well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.85,
      "end_seconds": 320.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.09,
      "end_seconds": 322.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.72,
      "end_seconds": 332.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Chest is clear and heart sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.51,
      "end_seconds": 337.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.34,
      "end_seconds": 341.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.91,
      "end_seconds": 342.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.92,
      "end_seconds": 376.46,
      "duration_seconds": 22.54,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with stable recovery after the heart event at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Medication side effects is also on my list. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had occasional chest tightness, severe, and no black stools or palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.32,
      "end_seconds": 378.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.88,
      "end_seconds": 383.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.22,
      "end_seconds": 389.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.31,
      "end_seconds": 414.0,
      "duration_seconds": 23.69,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an ECG for follow-up. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Please don't stop the blood thinner on your own, even if you feel fine. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 415.46,
      "end_seconds": 417.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Okay, um, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.14,
      "end_seconds": 431.93,
      "duration_seconds": 12.79,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Let's review you in six weeks. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 432.76,
      "end_seconds": 437.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "So, I come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 438.71,
      "end_seconds": 444.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "So, yes, exactly right. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 446.13,
      "end_seconds": 449.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Okay, thank you. I'll get started on all of that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 450.69,
      "end_seconds": 451.53,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}